when most people think of Batman's  nemesis they tend to think of the Joker  but lately it sounds like the Caped  Crusader's arch enemy is a PC my name is  Jake and here's why you might want to  hold off on buying Telltale's latest  adventure like Batman Arkham Knight  Batman the tell-tale series is  experiencing numerous issues if you've  been perusing user reviews on Steam  you've probably noticed a common theme  the game is suffering from frequent  crashes low frame rates resolution  problems and gamepad issues if you are  experiencing these issues you may need  to update your graphics card drivers but  that still may not fix it however it  seems these problems aren't happening to  everyone our reviewer had a relatively  problem-free experience as well as some  other people in our office but the game  crash for me six times during my first  playthrough and once during our live  stream as of now telltale has not issued  a statement but I'd be willing to bet  that a patch is on the way if you can't  wait that long to toad spandex and a  gravelly voice it may be worth getting  on ps4 or Xbox one if you have that  option for more on Batman and a ton of  gaming news keep those pointy ears  directed to GameSpot
 

